      "cooked": "<p>Lets say I've got a game with four heroes.</p><p>Legacy and Scholar are both at 30.</p><p>Wraith and Ra are both at 10.</p><p><br>Are Legacy and Scholar tied for second highest, or would Wratih and Ra be tied for second highest? I have a friend argue that 10 is the second highest in this situation, but I would say that Legacy and Scholar would both be 'second highest' as well as highest'.<br><br><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
