      "created_at": "2013-11-19T23:35:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy and Scholar would be tied for second highest. Like most things, if two people are tied for first place, they both would be written as being in first, while the third place person would still be written as being in third. So the first place people are pretty much first and second.</p>",
